          {model==='sam31'?<><div className="section-heading compact"><h3>Text prompts</h3><span className="tag">EXPERIMENTAL</span></div><label className="field-label">Describe a region<input aria-label="Text prompt" maxLength={160} value={String(ui.textPrompt||'')} placeholder="mountain, tree crowns, road, grass" onChange={e=>{invalidate();updateUI({textPrompt:e.target.value});}}/></label><p className="help">1–160 characters. Finds reviewable instances matching a concept. Empty results are valid. This uses only the SAM 3.1 image detector.</p><label className="field-label">Previous text prompts<select aria-label="Text prompt history" value="" onChange={e=>updateUI({textPrompt:e.target.value})}><option value="">Choose a previous phrase…</option>{[...new Set(runs.map(r=>r.prompts?.text).filter((text):text is string=>!!text))].map(text=><option key={text}>{text}</option>)}</select></label><div className="section-heading compact"><h3>Inference controls</h3></div><Range label="Detection confidence" value={settings.detection_threshold??.3} min={0} max={1} step={.01} onChange={v=>updateSettings({detection_threshold:v})}/><p className="help"><code>detection_threshold</code> · Min 0, max 1. Keeps detections above the combined object and concept-presence confidence. Higher values return fewer proposals.</p><Range label="Mask probability threshold" value={settings.mask_threshold??.5} min={0} max={1} step={.01} onChange={v=>updateSettings({mask_threshold:v})}/><p className="help"><code>mask_threshold</code> · Min 0, max 1. Pixel probability needed to join a mask. Higher values shrink uncertain edges. Both controls require a new run; prior masks remain unchanged.</p><Toggle label="Remove overlapping masks" checked={settings.remove_overlap??false} onChange={v=>updateSettings({remove_overlap:v})}/><Range label="Text overlap removal threshold" value={settings.overlap_threshold??80} min={0} max={100} step={1} unit="%" disabled={!settings.remove_overlap} onChange={v=>updateSettings({overlap_threshold:v})}/><p className="help">Min 0%, max 100%. Shared pixels divided by {settings.overlap_metric==='iou'?'union area':'smaller mask area'}. Hides the lower score; Show all restores proposals.</p></>:mode==='interactive'?<><div className="prompt-tools"><Button icon="plus" active={tool==='positive'} disabled={!image} onClick={()=>setTool('positive')}>Include</Button><Button icon="minus" active={tool==='negative'} disabled={!image} onClick={()=>setTool('negative')}>Exclude</Button><Button icon="box" active={tool==='box'} disabled={!image} onClick={()=>setTool('box')}>Box</Button></div><p className="help">Click an object to include it, add negative points to exclude regions, or draw a box. Drag markers to adjust; right-click a point to remove.</p><div className="prompt-summary"><span>{points.length} point{points.length===1?'':'s'}{box?' · 1 box':''}</span><button className="text-button" disabled={!points.length&&!box} onClick={()=>{invalidate();updateUI({points:[],box:null});}}>Clear prompts</button></div><details className="details"><summary>Exact source coordinates</summary><p className="help">Canonical pixels: x increases right, y increases down.</p><div className="coordinate-entry"><label>x<input type="number" min="0" max={(image?.width||1)-1} value={pointX} onChange={e=>setPointX(Number(e.target.value))}/></label><label>y<input type="number" min="0" max={(image?.height||1)-1} value={pointY} onChange={e=>setPointY(Number(e.target.value))}/></label><select aria-label="Point kind" value={pointLabel} onChange={e=>setPointLabel(Number(e.target.value) as 0|1)}><option value="1">Include</option><option value="0">Exclude</option></select><IconButton icon="plus" label="Add exact point" disabled={!image} onClick={()=>{if(!image)return;invalidate();updateUI({points:[...points,{x:Math.max(0,Math.min(image.width-1,pointX)),y:Math.max(0,Math.min(image.height-1,pointY)),label:pointLabel}]});}}/></div><div className="point-list">{points.map((point,i)=><div key={i}><span className={`point-sign ${point.label?'positive':'negative'}`}>{point.label?'+':'−'}</span><label className="sr-only" htmlFor={`px-${i}`}>Point {i+1} x</label><input id={`px-${i}`} type="number" aria-label={`Point ${i+1} x`} value={Math.round(point.x*10)/10} min="0" max={(image?.width||1)-1} onChange={e=>{invalidate();updateUI({points:points.map((p,n)=>n===i?{...p,x:Math.max(0,Math.min((image?.width||1)-1,Number(e.target.value)))}:p)});}}/><input type="number" aria-label={`Point ${i+1} y`} value={Math.round(point.y*10)/10} min="0" max={(image?.height||1)-1} onChange={e=>{invalidate();updateUI({points:points.map((p,n)=>n===i?{...p,y:Math.max(0,Math.min((image?.height||1)-1,Number(e.target.value)))}:p)});}}/><IconButton icon="close" label={`Remove point ${i+1}`} onClick={()=>{invalidate();updateUI({points:points.filter((_,n)=>i!==n)});}}/></div>)}</div>{box&&<div className="box-entry"><label>Box x₀, y₀, x₁, y₁</label><div>{box.map((value,index)=><input type="number" aria-label={`Box ${['x minimum','y minimum','x maximum','y maximum'][index]}`} key={index} min="0" value={Math.round(value)} onChange={e=>{const copy=[...box] as Box;copy[index]=Math.max(0,Math.min((index%2?image!.height:image!.width)-1,Number(e.target.value)));invalidate();updateUI({box:copy});}}/>)}</div><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{invalidate();updateUI({box:null});}}>Remove box</button></div>}</details></>:<><div className="automatic-note"><Icon name="layers"/><p>A grid of prompts proposes overlapping regions across the image. Review each instance; this is not a complete land-cover map.</p></div><div className="section-heading compact"><h3>Inference controls</h3><button className="text-button" disabled={!project} onClick={()=>{invalidate();updateUI({settings:{...baseline,...Object.values(status?.presets||{})[0]}});}}>Reset</button></div><label className="field-label">Run preset<select aria-label="Inference preset" value="" disabled={!project} onChange={e=>{const preset={...status?.presets,...ui.inferencePresets}[e.target.value];if(preset){invalidate();updateUI({settings:preset});}}}><option value="">Choose a preset…</option>{Object.keys({...status?.presets,...ui.inferencePresets}).map(key=><option key={key} value={key}>{key}</option>)}</select></label><Range label="Points per side" value={settings.points_per_side} min={2} max={32} step={1} onChange={value=>updateSettings({points_per_side:value})} disabled={!project}/><p className="help"><code>points_per_side</code> · Min 2, max 32. Samples a square grid; denser grids propose more objects. {settings.points_per_side} × {settings.points_per_side} = {number(settings.points_per_side**2)} point prompts. Changes require a new run.</p>{settings.points_per_side>=24&&<div className="inline-warning"><Icon name="warning" size={15}/>{(settings.points_per_side/8)**2}× the preview grid. Expect more time and memory.</div>}<Range label="Predicted quality threshold" value={settings.pred_iou_thresh} min={0} max={1} step={.01} onChange={value=>updateSettings({pred_iou_thresh:value})} disabled={!project}/><p className="help"><code>pred_iou_thresh</code> · Min 0, max 1. Keeps candidates above the model’s predicted mask quality. Higher values reject more proposals; this is not measured accuracy.</p><Range label="Stability threshold" value={settings.stability_score_thresh} min={0} max={1} step={.01} onChange={value=>updateSettings({stability_score_thresh:value})} disabled={!project}/><p className="help"><code>stability_score_thresh</code> · Min 0, max 1. Keeps masks whose pixels remain consistent when the mask cutoff shifts. Higher values reject less stable boundaries.</p><details className="details"><summary>Advanced inference controls</summary><Range label="Points per batch" value={settings.points_per_batch} min={1} max={16} step={1} onChange={value=>updateSettings({points_per_batch:value})} disabled={!project}/><p className="help"><code>points_per_batch</code> · Min 1, max 16. Prompts processed together. Larger batches use more memory; the app may lower the effective batch to fit its pixel budget. Both values are recorded.</p><Range label="Duplicate suppression (box NMS)" value={settings.box_nms_thresh} min={0} max={1} step={.01} onChange={value=>updateSettings({box_nms_thresh:value})} disabled={!project}/><p className="help"><code>box_nms_thresh</code> · Min 0, max 1. Suppresses lower-scoring proposals whose bounding-box IoU exceeds this value. Higher values keep more boxes; 1 disables suppression. This differs from exact mask overlap below. Requires a new run.</p><label className="field-label disabled">Crop layers · min 0, max 0<input value="0 · unavailable for this verified adapter" disabled/></label><label className="field-label disabled">Minimum-region / hole / sprinkle cleanup<input value="Off · no verified cleanup implementation" disabled/></label><div className="section-heading compact"><h3>Mask overlap filter</h3></div><label className="check-row"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Remove overlapping masks" checked={settings.remove_overlap??false} onChange={e=>updateSettings({remove_overlap:e.target.checked})} disabled={!project}/> Remove overlapping masks</label><p className="help">Choose before Run. Lower-scoring overlapping proposals are hidden; their original pixels remain saved. Use Show all in Masks to recover them.</p><label className="field-label">Overlap measurement<select aria-label="Overlap measurement" value={settings.overlap_metric??'smaller'} disabled={!project||!settings.remove_overlap} onChange={e=>updateSettings({overlap_metric:e.target.value as 'smaller'|'iou'})}><option value="smaller">Shared pixels ÷ smaller mask area</option><option value="iou">Shared pixels ÷ union area (IoU)</option></select></label><Range label="Overlap removal threshold" value={settings.overlap_threshold??80} min={0} max={100} step={1} unit="%" disabled={!project||!settings.remove_overlap} onChange={value=>updateSettings({overlap_threshold:value})}/><p className="help">Min 0%, max 100%. At 80%, suppress when at least 80% overlaps using the chosen measure. Smaller-area measurement detects nested masks. At 0%, any shared pixel qualifies; at 100%, only complete overlap qualifies. Ties keep the earlier proposal. Masks are never cut into pieces.</p><Button icon="save" disabled={!project} onClick={()=>{setName('');setDialog('inference-preset');}}>Save these settings</Button></details></>}
